 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 506180,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the sum of the first 10 terms of the geometric sequence with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1} = 7\">{a_1} = 7</span> and common ratio <span data-math=\"r = 6\">r = 6</span>?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The sum of the first <i>n</i> terms of a geometric sequence, with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1}\"></span> and common ratio <i>r</i>, is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{s_n} = {a_1}\\left( {\\frac{{1 - {r^n}}}{{1 - r}}} \\right)\"></span>, provided that <span data-math=\"r \\ne 1\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{s_{10}} = 7\\left( {\\frac{{1 - {6^{10}}}}{{1 - 6}}} \\right) = 84,652,645\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "84,652,645"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 506181,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is the sum of the first 6 terms of the geometric sequence with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1} = 27\">{a_1} = 27</span> and common ratio <span data-math=\"r = \\frac{1}{3}\">r = \\frac{1}{3}</span>?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The sum of the first <i>n</i> terms of a geometric sequence, with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1}\"></span> and common ratio <i>r</i>, is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{s_n} = {a_1}\\left( {\\frac{{1 - {r^n}}}{{1 - r}}} \\right)\"></span>, provided that <span data-math=\"r \\ne 1\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{s_6} = 27\\left( {\\frac{{1 - {{\\left( {\\frac{1}{3}} \\right)}^6}}}{{1 - \\frac{1}{3}}}} \\right) = \\frac{{364}}{9} \\approx 40.4444\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "40.444444"
    }
   ],
